      <text x='330' y='88' font-size='12' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>c_ub(π_u)：末任务 → 巢 b 的三维返航代价</text>
      <text x='330' y='372' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8'>粗蓝线 = 一次联合求解得到的最小费用流；细灰线 = 其余候选边（未选中）。</text>
      <rect x='736' y='16' width='404' height='386' rx='12' fill='#E8EFF8' />
      <text x='756' y='46' font-size='17' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>数学形式（路线给定后）</text>
      <text x='756' y='78' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#1E4FA8'>min Σ_u Σ_b c_ub(π_u) · z_ub</text>
      <text x='756' y='104' font-size='14' fill='#4A5568'>s.t.　Σ_b z_ub = 1（每机恰落一巢）</text>
      <text x='756' y='128' font-size='14' fill='#4A5568'>　　　泊位占用 ≤ 巢容量</text>
      <line x1='756' y1='146' x2='1120' y2='146' stroke='#C9D6E8' strokeWidth='1' />
      <text x='756' y='172' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>为什么必须联合求解</text>
      <text x='756' y='196' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>多架机可能同时盯上同一个剩余泊位；逐机取最近巢会让后者无巢可落，或被迫飞到很远的巢。</text>
      <text x='756' y='232' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>口径边界（必须显式声明）</text>
      <text x='756' y='256' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>这是「路线给定后」的条件最优，不等于归属 / 顺序 / 终点巢三者全局联合最优。</text>
      <text x='756' y='292' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>默认档与对照档</text>
      <text x='756' y='316' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>默认 auto：解码期与交付期均走 MCF；projection_only 或 end_nest_l1_mode=nearest 时，解码期降级为「最近合法巢」确定性投影。</text>
      <text x='756' y='356' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>配巢会拉长返航腿，因此配完巢后必须再闸一次航程。</text>
      <text x='756' y='384' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8'>代码：constraints/nest_capacity.py · decode_repair.py::_choose_end_nests</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 588, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 66, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 12, gap: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>终点机巢不进基因：存在多项式精确解，让搜索去解它只会拖慢收敛且找不到更优答案。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>返航代价进入 f 的 λ·C_path 完整评价；忽略它会出现「记账了航程、任务却解绑回池」的废飞。</Text>
  </Box>
